### Billing V1 payment-request discovery — implemented, opt-in, NOT live by default
### Requires MEDIFLOW_BILLING_LEDGER_ENABLED=true and MEDIFLOW_BILLING_PAYMENT_REQUEST_DISCOVERY_ENABLED=true.
### ADMIN/CASHIER signed access token only (no SYSTEM/service/refresh/PATIENT). GET only, no side effect.
### sourceId is appointmentId for EXAM, labId for LAB_TEST, prescriptionId for PRESCRIPTION.
### All four query values must match the persisted Billing relationship exactly; none grant access alone.
### Golden captured responses for these three shapes + a not-found error live at
### src/test/resources/contracts/payment-request-discovery-v1/{exam,lab,prescription,not-found}.json.

@host = http://localhost:8080
# @token = paste-admin-or-cashier-access-token-here

### EXAM — appointmentId doubles as careEpisodeId for this purpose.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/billing/payment-requests/by-source?purpose=EXAM&sourceId=00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002&patientId=00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003&careEpisodeId=00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Correlation-Id: discovery-exam-example

### LAB_TEST — sourceId is the labId; careEpisodeId is a separate outpatient-visit identity.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/billing/payment-requests/by-source?purpose=LAB_TEST&sourceId=00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002&patientId=00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003&careEpisodeId=00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Correlation-Id: discovery-lab-example

### PRESCRIPTION — sourceId is the prescriptionId.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/billing/payment-requests/by-source?purpose=PRESCRIPTION&sourceId=10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001&patientId=10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002&careEpisodeId=10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Correlation-Id: discovery-prescription-example

### Not yet issued / wrong patient-episode expectation -> 404 BILLING_PAYMENT_REQUEST_NOT_FOUND
### (same shape either way; never reveals a different patient's request). Bounded retry is safe.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/billing/payment-requests/by-source?purpose=EXAM&sourceId=01b75190-2efb-472c-bbaa-dbc41d049db9&patientId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000&careEpisodeId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Correlation-Id: discovery-not-found-example
